{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】冒險RPG「棕色塵埃2」攤位照片報導！盡情享受豪華Coser們為粉絲獻上的精彩表演</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/75458f4ac4b252ca5f80ad65c8e9d4a533e47cd9747f8c11c052c9f758d7b244/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F658948164c5a3abd491eb7a8fb8975f3\"/><p>2026年7月24日(五)至7月28日(二)舉辦中的「 ACGHK 2026 」，也就是「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026(香港動漫電玩節2026)」 這次將為大家介紹近期備受矚目的冒險RPG「 棕色塵埃2 」攤位的現場實況！</p><h3>冒險RPG「棕色塵埃2」攤位照片報導！豪華Cosplay造型備受矚目</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b6af77f9bdf5402df63d4225abe150f0ffb1a7de5ee3750f2495cf7d0c42a1a4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9706a8943efacdee716464c9de2c1077\"/><p>散發著壓倒性存在感的冒險RPG「 棕色塵埃2 」攤位！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/08d37808914cd5ddff688a22c7eee2239c20359a03fb3520ab724f813368bc16/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F634820024ec9be51d4d408e1ec348937\"/><p>攤位內也進行了周邊商品的販售。</p><h3>還原度極高！Cosplayer們齊聚一堂</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c246d7deaff8b6b30dc708bf92fab68150e464a7dac91cd3e2787f4e96aafca5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc296e01cf47602715b36db220511bbdf\"/><p>展位內將有忠實重現作品魅力的性感Cosplayer登場！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/39faa94b3796359d2a7cec82eed574944dd8a4b61cb422dc3c701ae187df610c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F073b61c250649eb8c392aac57f2375ed\"/><p>攤位周圍始終擠滿了舉著相機的粉絲！</p><p>九尾 / JooA(@ja10888) &amp; 葛蘭西爾德 / 研智YEONJI(@Carmineee__)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4fca9163517123c7881bca47e717bfc5851efae7bcb71ba75d3a45eaed74e9aa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa91d05705c5be06015f9713e358f6896\"/><p>對粉絲的服務也十分貼心周到，將現場氣氛炒得沸騰！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4e0d026c47fa61e1664d6d4c82a1729df9453460fbd1f8051e220903163cd3f3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd997a8bea5db26280e274a294d8cb530\"/><p>成熟可靠、冷豔帥氣的姊姊系角色「 魯本西亞 」以海洋先鋒的Cosplay造型登場。</p><p>魯本西亞 / 研智YEONJI(@Carmineee__)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f483e08a82b84abae9bdfdd32cc87896ed7e8d4cfb4b59d6da422e227b2f1f01/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2f80f5a8cff1b757eee617d4155f517f\"/><p>清爽的短髮與髮飾簡直是絕配。</p><p>可愛・・・！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/13cb105d14f5859a06d508f296eefc2e4563f21826624ff9e2f73d18735b1396/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3b2199ce63e28d6a357a8ed99574bd72\"/><p>品質實在太高了！</p><p>莎拉 / 蜜汁猫裘Meeu(@Meeu228744495)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9e22728895b7fa93e23e3e562c8db132640691aa6b620724e0e50fe5cdec6ef5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F93fa6358475ac5447447ffa5adb9f2fd\"/><p>無論是線條還是心靈都會被深深吸引，這確實是「視覺盛宴」一詞再貼切不過、讓人心滿意足的區域。</p><p>達麗安 / rioko涼涼子(@rioko041120)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a038adb228f8e7d3e26bf42d9234e001076216c376b16f5133b431a05020246f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb6a0a76aefbf56fc6757b39f7fe98923\"/><p>那股神秘的氛圍格外突出。</p><p>艾莉絲</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2e241fd6c27c46d07341d8fd339e7b57c8c9ccf9f3c97458d5dd365b76109f15/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc8c8271a0a0b7b588093ffdfcb89abd8\"/><p>人氣角色們齊聚一堂。</p><p>以上，為各位帶來了吸引全場目光的華麗Cosplay們的精彩畫面！</p><p>✅「Esports World Cup 2025」快打旋風6部門Xiaohai選手達成2連霸！獎金約3,700萬日圓 ✅四月騎士舉辦電競企業交流戰！遊戲標題為「Auto Chess:Origin」 ✅Capcom Café的「魔物獵人荒野」聯名菜單公開！內含回復藥瓶套餐與抗蜘蛛恐懼症模式果凍等商品 ✅今年冬天也一起線上同樂吧！「RTA in Japan 2020」將於2月27日開幕！ ✅TGS2021線下會場的「萬代南夢宮娛樂」攤位中「小小夢魘2」的世界就在眼前！ ✅日語到繁體中文的翻譯者招聘</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T10:19:07.243136+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":925,"images":12,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}